<title>ESTONIA: Estonian c.bank assets rise in December.</title>
<headline>Estonian c.bank assets rise in December.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank of Estonia's assets rose in December to 9.058 billion kroons from November's 8.739 billion, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Of this, convertible foreign currency increased to 7.917 billion kroons compared to November's 7.611 billion kroons.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that December cash in circulation increased to 4.99 billion kroons from 4.69 billion kroons in November.</p>
<p>Gold and foreign currency reserves backing the kroon rose to 7.96 billion kroons from 7.65 billion kroons, the bank added.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
